{"id":8860456517831,"title":"Personalized Books in Bun Girl Reading on Antique Books Throw Blanket","handle":"personalized-books-in-bun-girl-reading-on-antique-books-throw-blanket","description":"\u003cp\u003eWrap yourself in comfort with this cozy and personalized blanket, designed especially for book lovers. This unique throw from Jeminise is the perfect way to celebrate your passion for reading or to give as a thoughtful gift to a fellow book enthusiast.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMeaningful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e A thoughtful and personal present that any book lover will cherish, highlighting their love for reading.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomizable Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Make it uniquely yours by adding personal touches such as skin color, hairstyle, and name for a one-of-a-kind blanket.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Choose from Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches) for the perfect fit.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eThoughtful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ideal for special occasions like birthdays, Christmas, or as a heartfelt surprise for a reader.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eComfort and Style:\u003c\/strong\u003e A beautifully designed, personalized blanket that brings warmth and a stylish touch to any reading nook.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e Made from durable Polyester with a lightweight feel, perfect for year-round comfort.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e This blanket is machine washable for convenient and simple cleaning.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eBrand\u